  "Solution": "For \\(x + 6 = 18\\), subtract 6 from both sides to get \\(x = 12\\).\n\nAlternative method 1: Subtract from the ones\n\nSince \\(18\\) has one ten and eight ones, subtract \\(6\\) from the eight ones:\n\\[\n18-6=10+(8-6)=12.\n\\]\nThe answer is \\(12\\).",
